{"case_id":"T8038","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["input semantics","attack surface","configuration"],"commit_induced":"YES","maintenance_needed":true,"confidence":99,"affected_functions":["ProtoConverter::visit(NullaryOp const&)","ProtoConverter::evmVersionMapping(Program_Version const&)","EVMVersion::hasOpcode(Instruction) const","TypeChecker::visit(MemberAccess const&)","ExpressionCompiler::visit(MemberAccess const&)","IRGeneratorForStatements::endVisit(MemberAccess const&)","AsmAnalyzer::validateInstructions(evmasm::Instruction, SourceLocation const&)"],"reason":"S1 introduces the Amsterdam-gated SLOTNUM opcode, the Yul builtin slotnum(), and Solidity block.slotnum, but H0 cannot generate that new operation. H0 can select Program::AMSTERDAM through ProtoConverter::evmVersionMapping(), yet ProtoConverter::visit(NullaryOp const&) has no SLOTNUM case, so fuzz input cannot directly exercise the newly added opcode parsing, version validation, code generation, or block-member handling. This gap did not exist in S0 because SLOTNUM and block.slotnum were introduced by S1.","evidence":["Instruction::SLOTNUM = 0x4b is newly declared in Instruction.h and registered as \"SLOTNUM\" in c_instructions and c_instructionInfo.","EVMVersion::hasSlotNum() is newly defined as available from amsterdam(), and EVMVersion::hasOpcode() newly dispatches SLOTNUM to it.","AsmAnalyzer::validateInstructions() newly validates SLOTNUM and rejects it before Amsterdam.","MagicType::nativeMembers() newly exposes \"slotnum\", while ExpressionCompiler::visit() emits Instruction::SLOTNUM and IRGeneratorForStatements::endVisit() emits \"slotnum()\".","H0's ProtoConverter::evmVersionMapping() includes Program::AMSTERDAM, providing the required configuration selection.","H0's ProtoConverter::visit(NullaryOp const&) enumerates existing zero-argument operations through BLOBBASEFEE but contains no SLOTNUM branch and therefore cannot emit \"slotnum()\"."],"recommended_action":"Extend H0's structured input model with a SLOTNUM nullary operation and add a ProtoConverter::visit(NullaryOp const&) branch that emits slotnum() only when m_evmVersion.hasSlotNum(), otherwise substituting a dictionary token, consistent with the existing BASEFEE and BLOBBASEFEE handling."}
